

you will need the termingus fonts in order for this to work : 

$ 
$ cd $HOME
$ rm -rf $HOME/.fonts/ $HOME/.cache/fontconfig
$ mkdir .fonts
$ rm -rf termingus
$ git clone git@github.com:neutaaaaan/termingus.git
Cloning into 'termingus'...
remote: Enumerating objects: 249, done.
remote: Counting objects: 100% (249/249), done.
remote: Compressing objects: 100% (174/174), done.
remote: Total 249 (delta 160), reused 164 (delta 75), pack-reused 0
Receiving objects: 100% (249/249), 489.85 KiB | 4.62 MiB/s, done.
Resolving deltas: 100% (160/160), done.
$ cd termingus/
$ cp -p termingus* $HOME/.fonts
$ cd $HOME/.fonts
$ mkfontscale
$ mkfontdir
$ xset +fp $HOME/.fonts
$ fc-cache -fv

Verify that you have the termingus fonts with : 

$ xlsfonts -l | grep -c 'termingus'
14
$ 


To disable the screensave or screen blanker 

 xset -dpms


